				With Local Radio, you can listen to your own music in Rideshare “Stimulator”.
The station plays tracks straight from a folder on your PC.


  1. From the main menu, go to Settings → Audio.  

  2. Select Open Local Radio Folder.   
This opens the data\my_radio folder inside the game’s install directory.

  3. Add your music files to this folder. Supported formats: MP3, OGG, WAV.  

  4. Switch back to the game.   
  Note:   If you add tracks during gameplay, you’l...			&lt;/div&gt;
